      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This review highlights some of the advances in sleep apnoea/hypopnoea syndrome made over the last few years, particularly in diagnosis and treatment. Recent evidence of the controversial associations of sleep apnoea/hypopnoea syndrome with increased morbidity and mortality, particularly from cardiovascular disease, is presented."},
